<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>文章 on Hassenfeld</title><link>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/</link><description>Recent content in 文章 on Hassenfeld</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</managingEditor><webMaster>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</webMaster><copyright>© 2026 **Hassenfeld**. All rights reserved.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hassenfeld.org/posts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>02.Building Effective Agents</title><link>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260428-02.buildingeffectiveagents/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</author><guid>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260428-02.buildingeffectiveagents/</guid><description>本文探讨了构建高效 LLM 代理的实用模式。文章区分了预定义工作流与自主代理，详细介绍了 Prompt 链、路由、并行化和评估者-优化者循环等常见模式，并强调了将简洁性和透明度作为核心设计原则。</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260428-02.buildingeffectiveagents/feature.jpg"/></item><item><title>01.Introducing Contextual Retrieval</title><link>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260425-01.introducingcontextualretrieval/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</author><guid>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260425-01.introducingcontextualretrieval/</guid><description>介绍语境化检索（Contextual Retrieval），这是一种通过为文本块添加特定语境信息，并结合语境化嵌入和语境化 BM25 技术大幅提升 RAG 检索准确度（最高达 67%）的方法，有效解决了传统 RAG 中文本块丢失语境的问题。</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260425-01.introducingcontextualretrieval/feature.jpg"/></item><item><title>00.Introduction</title><link>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260420-00.introduction/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</author><guid>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260420-00.introduction/</guid><description/><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260420-00.introduction/feature.jpg"/></item><item><title>建站</title><link>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260325-stationbuilt/</link><pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>chengxue.han654@gmail.com (Hassenfeld)</author><guid>https://hassenfeld.org/posts/20260325-stationbuilt/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>